---
const brands = [
  { name: 'FURSYS', logo: '/brands/fursys.svg' },
  { name: 'DESKER', logo: '/brands/desker.svg' },
  { name: 'SIDIZ', logo: '/brands/sidiz.svg' },
  { name: 'BESTUHL', logo: '/brands/bestuhl.png' },
  { name: 'PATRA', logo: '/brands/patra.svg' },
  { name: 'ILOOM' },
  { name: 'ALLOSO', logo: '/brands/alloso.svg' },
  { name: '맞춤 제작' }
];
---

<section class="editorial-hero" aria-labelledby="editorial-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="editorial-intro">
      <div class="editorial-heading">
        <p class="editorial-category">공공기관·기업 사무가구 제안 및 납품</p>
        <h1 id="editorial-title">공공의 공간을<br />더 나은 일터로.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="editorial-description">
        <p>예산·규격에 맞는 가구 선정부터<br />배치 제안, 납품·설치까지.</p>
        <p class="editorial-detail">기관의 목적과 일하는 방식에 맞는<br />사무환경을 함께 완성합니다.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">프로젝트 상담하기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="editorial-figure">
      <img
        class="editorial-photo"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366811353-6870744d04b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=88"
        alt="창가에 회의용 테이블과 의자가 배치된 밝은 업무공간"
        width="2200"
        height="1467"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <figcaption>
        <span>가구 선정에서 공간 배치까지</span>
        <span class="editorial-photo-note">업무공간 참고 이미지</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="editorial-brands" id="brands" aria-labelledby="editorial-brands-title">
      <div class="editorial-brands-heading">
        <h2 id="editorial-brands-title">공간에 맞춰 선택하는 브랜드</h2>
        <a href="/brands/">취급 브랜드 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <ul class="editorial-brand-list">
        {brands.map(brand => (
          <li>
            {brand.logo ? <img src={brand.logo} alt={brand.name} width="108" height="32" /> : <span>{brand.name}</span>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .editorial-hero {
    padding-top: 84px;
    background: var(--mist);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .editorial-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: end;
    padding: 52px 0 44px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .editorial-category {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .editorial-category::before {
    content: '';
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    background: var(--lime);
    border: 1px solid #6c8e37;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6.7vw, 96px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
  }

  .editorial-description {
    border-left: 1px solid #cbd3ce;
    padding-left: 32px;
  }

  .editorial-description p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
  }

  .editorial-description .editorial-detail {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .editorial-description .btn {
    margin-top: 26px;
    gap: 36px;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .editorial-figure {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
  }

  .editorial-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(320px, 32vw, 480px);
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 58%;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 14px 0 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd3ce;
  }

  .editorial-photo-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .editorial-brands {
    padding: 28px 0 40px;
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .editorial-brands-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .editorial-brands-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
  }

  .editorial-brands-heading a {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .editorial-brand-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .editorial-brand-list li {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 40px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .editorial-brand-list img {
    max-width: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .editorial-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .editorial-description { padding-left: 24px; }
    .editorial-description p { font-size: 16px; }
    .editorial-brand-list { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .editorial-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 36px 0 28px;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .editorial-category { font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 8.5vw, 58px); }
    .editorial-description { border: 0; padding: 0; }
    .editorial-description .editorial-detail br { display: none; }
    .editorial-description .btn { margin-top: 20px; }
    .editorial-photo { height: 300px; }
    figcaption { font-size: 11px; gap: 8px; }
    .editorial-photo-note { font-size: 10px; }
    .editorial-brands-heading { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .editorial-brand-list { column-gap: 18px; row-gap: 20px; }
    .editorial-brand-list li { font-size: 13px; }
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .home-editorial > header {
    background: var(--mist);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd3ce;
  }

  .home-editorial > header .logo small { color: var(--muted); }
  .home-editorial > header .logo { font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; }
  .home-editorial > header .nav-cta { border-color: #b4beb7; }
  .home-editorial a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #58751e; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .home-editorial .contact-grid > *,
  .home-editorial .form > * { min-width: 0; }
</style>
